の少年は全裸で帽子だけをかぶっている。ベストの少年はベストを着て、下にはふんどしをつけている。ベストの少年は杖を持ち、鞭を打ちながら追いかける。また、ベストの少年は布切れを持っており、スパンキングが終わった後、キャップ少年のお尻に布切れを当てる準備をしている。", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 394905, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "龍我@Skeb open", "screen_name": "ruugapp", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1526915863172919296/ElVCwaa_.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1250761774028091393/1667781843/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 8, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "novel"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 48}, {"id": 426971, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "鶴田文学", "screen_name": "tsuruta", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1929796446209097728/I9GNRZHG.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/15969785/1710895209/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 176}, {"id": 445089, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "じゃこた", "screen_name": "jacotei_jacota", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1774634670170488832/BoPNod-W.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/989465790310039554/1711940863/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "s